{"about_the_game":"Countryballs: The Heist is PWA's humorous Countryball stealth adventure based on its popular YouTube series. Customise your Countryball with unique disguises and travel undercover around the world, stealing crazy things for even crazier clients. Plan, sabotage, sneak, and outwit your way to dubious fame as a master thief, or become a creator of genius heists for the community yourself, using the built-in Heist Editor.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/e5a001aca73de3d7cf234c2611d8f0e0.poster.avif?t=1758895772\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/e5a001aca73de3d7cf234c2611d8f0e0.webm?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/e5a001aca73de3d7cf234c2611d8f0e0.mp4?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Very Own Countryball Master Thief</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/bf4e18a7e19c422160ffef2585a58651.poster.avif?t=1758895772\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/bf4e18a7e19c422160ffef2585a58651.webm?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/bf4e18a7e19c422160ffef2585a58651.mp4?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Customise your individual disguise from a colossal collection of over 250 unlockable flags and skins. Whether it's the icy Arctic, the sandy Sahara, a posh pool party, or a secret space station: Blend in \u2013 or blast off!<br><br><strong>Become the Main Character of PWA's Countryball Universe</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/5eef45c6279b64d8d014bf0b34648ab8.poster.avif?t=1758895772\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/5eef45c6279b64d8d014bf0b34648ab8.webm?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/5eef45c6279b64d8d014bf0b34648ab8.mp4?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience PWA's story about the thieving Countryballs, viewed and loved by millions\u2026 with YOU as the main protagonist.<br>As a Countryball rookie who (unwillingly) signs up with a shady spy agency, you embark on a crazy journey around the world, encountering many familiar Countryball characters... and their quirks.<br><br><strong>Endless Hot Heists \u2013 Thanks to Your Community</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/d54029f848d0aa023ee6b0e6e2e18ef3.poster.avif?t=1758895772\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/d54029f848d0aa023ee6b0e6e2e18ef3.webm?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/d54029f848d0aa023ee6b0e6e2e18ef3.mp4?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Download heists of your friends (and foes) and embark on ever new adventures \u2013 or become a heist creator yourself and design challenging Heists for a global player base using the integrated Heist Editor. This versatile editor allows you to create complete heists with your own story in your native language and share them with the community.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1986290?t=1758895772","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758895772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758895772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758895772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Countryballs: The Heist is PWA's humorous Countryball stealth adventure based on its popular YouTube series. Customise your Countryball with unique disguises and travel undercover around the world, stealing crazy things for even crazier clients. Plan, sabotage, sneak, and outwit your way to dubious fame as a master thief, or become a creator of genius heists for the community yourself, using the built-in Heist Editor.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/e5a001aca73de3d7cf234c2611d8f0e0.poster.avif?t=1758895772\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/e5a001aca73de3d7cf234c2611d8f0e0.webm?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986290/extras/e5a001aca73de3d7cf234c2611d8f0e0.mp4?t=1758895772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Very Own Countryball Master Thief</strong><br><spa